.TH INGAUGE 1 "August 2026" "InGauge 0.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ingauge \- observe and forecast local inference capacity
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ingauge
[--json] [--config PATH] COMMAND
.SH COMMANDS
status, providers, discover, probe, history, forecast, next, health, daemon, config, db, export.
.SH FILES
$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/ingauge/ingauge.toml and the configured SQLite history database.
.SH SECURITY
Remote endpoints require HTTPS. Credentials are resolved from environment variables named in configuration and are never persisted.
